+-- The relay owns these four names: it appends them to the tail of every envelope it
+-- forwards, and the receiving bridge reads them from there. An envelope that already
+-- carries one is a client writing a field only the server may write, so it is dropped
+-- here rather than forwarded with the peer's copy in front of the relay's own.
+local RESERVED_FIELDS = { "sender", "senderPlayerId", "senderName", "serverTick" }
+
